# QA Artifacts

- Manual cases: `manual-test-cases/{STORY-KEY}.md` using `templates/manual-test-case.md`
- Reports: `qa-report-{STORY-KEY}.md` using `templates/qa-report.md`
- Required categories: Positive, Negative, Boundary, Error Handling, Security, Integration
- Header must include coverage % and requirement mapping
- Link manual ↔ automated via TC ids (`TC-001`, …)
